## 5. Non-Functional Requirements
*(Adopted from FitAll, scoped down for Phase 1 launch, expanding at scale)*

- **Performance:** cold start ≤2s; logging screen response ≤1s
- **Offline support:** core logging must work offline and sync on reconnect
- **Cross-platform:** iOS and Android at parity for launch; web at feature parity for non-logging features
- **Accessibility:** WCAG 2.1 AA compliance, VoiceOver/TalkBack support
- **Privacy/Security:** health data encrypted at rest and in transit; GDPR/CCPA compliant from day one (design for HIPAA-adjacent handling ahead of Phase 2 nutrition/recovery data, which is more sensitive)
- **Scalability:** architecture should support scaling to 500K+ users without a data-model rewrite, even though Phase 1 targets a smaller launch cohort

