## 6. Success Metrics

### 6.1 Phase 1 Launch Metrics (6 months post-launch)
| Metric | Target |
|---|---|
| Activation: first logged workout within 24 hrs | ≥ 60% |
| Weekly active users logging ≥1 workout | ≥ 40% of installs |
| Avg. time to log a full workout | < 5 minutes |
| 4-week retention | ≥ 35% |
| Workouts logged per active user/week | ≥ 2.5 |
| App Store / Play Store rating | ≥ 4.5 |

### 6.2 Longer-Term Business Metrics (post Phase 2–3)
| Metric | Target |
|---|---|
| Monthly Active Users | 500K within 12 months of full-scope launch |
| Day-30 retention | 40% (vs. ~25% industry avg) |
| Free-to-paid conversion (90 days) | 8% |

Phase 1 intentionally omits monetization/MAU-scale targets — those only become meaningful once the core habit loop is proven.

