## 8. Monetization

Introduced starting Phase 2 — Phase 1 stays free to maximize activation and retention data quality while the core habit is being validated.

| Tier | Price | Includes |
|---|---|---|
| Free | $0 | Full Phase 1 logging feature set, limited template library |
| Premium | $9.99/mo or $79.99/yr | Full program/template library, nutrition tracking, adaptive plans, no ads |
| Premium+ | $14.99/mo | Advanced analytics, wearable integrations, family sharing (up to 5) |

