## 9. Proposed Milestones

| Phase | Timeline | Deliverable |
|---|---|---|
| Discovery & Design | Weeks 1–4 | User research, wireframes, tech architecture (designed for Phase 2+ extensibility) |
| Phase 1 MVP Build | Weeks 5–14 | Onboarding, logging, history/PRs, templates, dashboard, offline mobile |
| Phase 1 Beta | Weeks 15–18 | Closed beta (2K users) |
| Phase 1 Launch | Week 20 | Public launch, iOS + Android + web |
| Retention Gate Review | Week 20 + 4 weeks | Go/no-go on Phase 2 based on 4-week retention data |
| Phase 2 Build | Post-gate, ~10 weeks | Nutrition, recovery, wearables, adaptive programming |
| Phase 3–4 | Ongoing | Cardio, social, growth loops — sequenced based on engagement data |

